SHE MANAGED THE FIRST SEVEN
YEARS OF MY CAREER,

91
00:04:08,853 --> 00:04:10,922
SO TODAY WE'RE JUST GONNA TALK
TO YOU GUYS

92
00:04:10,922 --> 00:04:12,891
ABOUT THIS WHOLE BUSINESS
SIDE OF MODELING.

93
00:04:12,891 --> 00:04:14,359
I NEED TO LEARN
ABOUT THAT KIND OF STUFF,

94
00:04:14,359 --> 00:04:16,528
'CAUSE I DON'T KNOW MUCH
OF THE BUSINESS.

95
00:04:16,528 --> 00:04:18,964
I WANT INTRODUCE A GENTLEMAN
THAT YOU GUYS ALREADY MET.

96
00:04:18,964 --> 00:04:20,498
DON BANKS.

97
00:04:20,498 --> 00:04:21,700
THIS IS
MY FATHER.

98
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:23,535
OH!

99
00:04:23,535 --> 00:04:24,536
GREETINGS, LADIES.

100
00:04:24,536 --> 00:04:25,770
I KNEW IT!

101
00:04:25,770 --> 00:04:28,406
I WANT TO ALSO
