102
00:04:28,406 --> 00:04:30,408
A REALLY GREAT
LAWYER.

103
00:04:30,408 --> 00:04:32,410
THE PAPER THAT
YOU GUYS SIGNED TODAY,

104
00:04:32,410 --> 00:04:35,847
YOU PRETTY MUCH SIGNED
YOUR LIVES AWAY.

105
00:04:35,847 --> 00:04:38,450
I OWN YOU NOW.

106
00:04:38,450 --> 00:04:40,819
YES, MY FATHER DON BANKS
OWNS YOU IN PERPETUITY,

107
00:04:40,819 --> 00:04:42,754
WHICH MEANS FOREVER.

108
00:04:42,754 --> 00:04:44,222
