RIGHT NOW?

111
00:04:47,826 --> 00:04:49,527
EVERY TIME YOU HEAR
THE WORD "MODEL."

112
00:04:49,527 --> 00:04:53,231
MODEL, MODEL,
MODELS ARE VERY IMPORTANT.

113
00:04:53,231 --> 00:04:54,966
EVERYTHING YOU SIGN
IS VERY IMPORTANT,

114
00:04:54,966 --> 00:04:57,302
WHETHER YOU KNOW
WHAT'S IN IT OR NOT.

115
00:04:57,302 --> 00:04:59,738
IF YOU HAVE DOUBTS,
TRUST YOUR INSTINCTS.

116
00:04:59,738 --> 00:05:01,373
DON'T SIGN IT.

117
00:05:01,373 --> 00:05:03,241
