TO TAKE ALL THESE CLASSES,

136
00:05:38,877 --> 00:05:40,478
SO THEY COULD TURN ME
INTO SOMETHING.

137
00:05:40,478 --> 00:05:42,547
IT'S IMPORTANT
FOR YOU ALL TO KNOW

138
00:05:42,547 --> 00:05:45,450
AND FOR ALL YOUNG GIRLS
EVERYWHERE TO UNDERSTAND,

139
00:05:45,450 --> 00:05:49,788
