THAT THEY ARE REPUTABLE.

145
00:06:03,535 --> 00:06:04,969
WHEN I STARTED,

146
00:06:04,969 --> 00:06:07,405
I ALWAYS TOOK THIS INDUSTRY
AS A BUSINESS,

147
