00:16:00,831 --> 00:16:03,768
MICHELLE, THEY FELT THAT
YOU DIDN'T LOOK COMFORTABLE

464
00:16:03,768 --> 00:16:05,836
AND THAT YOUR SKIRT
WAS TOO SHORT.

465
00:16:05,836 --> 00:16:08,706
WITH THAT, THE WINNER
OF TONIGHT'S CHALLENGE

466
00:16:08,706 --> 00:16:11,275
GETS TO PICK
ONE FRIEND,

467
00:16:11,275 --> 00:16:13,511
AND YOU GUYS GET TO SPEND
AN AMAZING NIGHT

468
00:16:13,511 --> 00:16:15,546
AT A FABULOUS HOTEL
ON THE BEACH.

469
00:16:15,546 --> 00:16:17,415
SO THE JUDGES HAD
TO CHOOSE SOMEONE,

470
00:16:17,415 --> 00:16:20,651
AND WHO THEY FEEL
MOST EXEMPLIFIED A COVER GIRL

471
00:16:20,651 --> 00:16:23,888
AT TONIGHT'S EVENT...

472
00:16:23,888 --> 00:16:25,456
WAS KEENYAH.

473
00:16:25,456 --> 00:16:27,191
COME UP HERE.

474
00:16:27,191 --> 00:16:30,461
AND I'M LIKE,
"ARE YOU SERIOUS?"

475
00:16:30,461 --> 00:16:32,963
BECAUSE THIS WHOLE TIME,
I NEVER WIN.

476
00:16:32,963 --> 00:16:35,266
SO WHO ARE YOU GONNA PICK
TO GO TO YOUR EVENT TONIGHT?

477
00:16:35,266 --> 00:16:38,502
I'M GONNA PICK
BRITTANY.

478
00:16:38,502 --> 00:16:39,870
(squeals)

479
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:42,306
I DON'T KNOW IF KEENYAH'S
LOOKING FOR THIS BIG SISTER,

480
00:16:42,306 --> 00:16:43,841
BUT BRITTANY AND KEENYAH
NEED TO STICK TOGETHER.

481
00:16:43,841 --> 00:16:45,376
THEY NEED
TO GET CUT TOGETHER.

482
00:16:45,376 --> 00:16:46,644
DON'T FOCUS ON THE BOOZE
SO MUCH!

483
00:16:46,644 --> 00:16:47,812
I WASN'T!

484
00:16:47,812 --> 00:16:48,846
YOU GOTTA FOCUS
ON THE PEOPLE!

485
00:16:48,846 --> 00:16:49,880
YOU GUYS HAVE
A GOOD TIME TONIGHT,

486
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:50,881
AND I'LL SEE
YOU GUYS LATER.

487
00:16:50,881 --> 00:16:53,317
♪♪♪

488
00:16:54,919 --> 00:16:56,620
PLUSH BEDS.

489
00:16:56,620 --> 00:16:58,389
AND WE WON'T BE GETTING IN
FOR HOURS.

490
00:16:58,389 --> 00:17:00,191
(laughs)

491
00:17:00,191 --> 00:17:03,227
WHAT'S GOING ON
IN HERE?

492
00:17:03,227 --> 00:17:04,729
WE WALK INSIDE,

493
00:17:04,729 --> 00:17:07,398
AND THERE'S, LIKE,
THIS HUGE TRAY FULL OF DESSERTS

494
00:17:07,398 --> 00:17:09,934
AND ALL THE V.I.P. TREATMENT
TYPE STUFF.

495
00:17:09,934 --> 00:17:12,737
AND WE'RE LIKE,
"WHOA, THIS IS, LIKE, CRAZY."

496
00:17:12,737 --> 00:17:14,338
(laughs)

497
00:17:14,338 --> 00:17:15,473
YOUR BUTT.

498
00:17:15,473 --> 00:17:16,707
MY BUTT!

499
00:17:19,844 --> 00:17:21,312
HEY, TYRA MAIL!

500
00:17:21,312 --> 00:17:23,481
♪ TYRA MAIL ♪♪

501
00:17:23,481 --> 00:17:24,781
"THE COMPETITION'S
GETTING TOUGHER.

502
00:17:24,781 --> 00:17:26,250
"ARE YOU RUNNING
OUT OF GAS?

503
00:17:26,250 --> 00:17:27,418
"BE READY AT 6:30
IN THE MORNING."

504
00:17:27,418 --> 00:17:28,586
WHO HAS GAS?

505
00:17:28,586 --> 00:17:30,755
"ARE YOU RUNNING
OUT OF GAS?"

506
00:17:30,755 --> 00:17:32,890
I HOPE WE AIN'T GOT TO PUSH
NO DAMN CARS NOWHERE.

507
00:17:32,890 --> 00:17:34,191
THIS LOOKS GOOD.

508
00:17:34,191 --> 00:17:35,292
THIS IS
REALLY GOOD.

509
00:17:35,292 --> 00:17:36,327
WHAT DO WE
GOT HERE?

510
00:17:36,327 --> 00:17:39,363
YOU SHOULD
READ IT.

511
00:17:39,363 --> 00:17:40,731
"CONGRATULATIONS.

512
00:17:40,731 --> 00:17:42,633
"ENJOY YOUR V.I.P.
SURROUNDINGS.

513
00:17:42,633 --> 00:17:44,769
"AS AN ADDED BONUS
TO YOUR WIN,

514
00:17:44,769 --> 00:17:48,806
"YOU HAVE THE PRIVILEGE OF
SHOWING UP FASHIONABLY LATE."

515
00:17:48,806 --> 00:17:51,809
LATE TO WHERE?

516
00:17:51,809 --> 00:17:54,512
WE GET TO BE FASHIONABLY LATE,
WHICH IS GREAT,

517
00:17:54,512 --> 00:17:57,481
BECAUSE WE HAVE TO WAKE UP
SO EARLY EVERY MORNING.

518
00:17:57,481 --> 00:18:02,253
THIS IS A TOAST TO MY VERY BEST
FRIEND IN THE HOUSE, KEENYAH!

519
00:18:02,253 --> 00:18:06,357
I GIVE HER A TOAST
FOR PICKING ME, HER BEST FRIEND.

520
00:18:10,461 --> 00:18:12,263
I FEEL CLOSE
TO EVERYBODY,

521
00:18:12,263 --> 00:18:14,765
BUT YET, LIKE, IT'S
REALLY LONELY AT TIMES, TOO.

522
00:18:14,765 --> 00:18:15,833
SO HOW ARE YOU?

523
00:18:15,833 --> 00:18:17,234
NOT GOOD.

524
00:18:17,234 --> 00:18:19,336
WHY, WHAT'S WRONG?

525
00:18:19,336 --> 00:18:21,806
THIS IS
SO STUPID.

526
00:18:21,806 --> 00:18:23,941
I KNOW I DON'T LOOK LIKE
THE GIRL NEXT DOOR.

527
00:18:23,941 --> 00:18:25,376
I DON'T THINK
I'M BEAUTIFUL.

528
00:18:25,376 --> 00:18:26,911
I JUST THINK
I'M WEIRD-LOOKING.

529
00:18:26,911 --> 00:18:28,279
I'M DIFFERENT.

530
00:18:28,279 --> 00:18:29,413
YOU DON'T WANT TO CHANGE
WHO YOU ARE.

531
00:18:29,413 --> 00:18:30,815
I JUST WANT
MY PUPPY.

532
00:18:30,815 --> 00:18:31,916
I LOVE YOU.

533
00:18:31,916 --> 00:18:33,517
I'M JUST
COMPLETELY LOST,

534
00:18:33,517 --> 00:18:34,952
AND I DON'T UNDERSTAND
WHAT'S GOING ON

535
00:18:34,952 --> 00:18:36,921
IN GOD'S LITTLE PLAN
UP THERE.

536
00:18:36,921 --> 00:18:38,689
BYE, BABY, BYE.

537
00:18:38,689 --> 00:18:40,724
THAT'S THE ONLY THING
I CAN KEEP THINKING ABOUT

538
00:18:40,724 --> 00:18:43,861
IS TYRA TELLING US PEOPLE ARE
GONNA JUDGE YOU RIGHT OFFHAND

539
00:18:43,861 --> 00:18:45,729
AND MAKE COMMENTS THAT
YOU'RE NOT GONNA WANT TO HEAR,

540
00:18:45,729 --> 00:18:47,364
AND THEY'RE GONNA
CRITIQUE YOU.

541
00:18:47,364 --> 00:18:48,532
BUT IT'S LIKE, YOU HAVE
TO BRUSH THAT STUFF OFF

542
00:18:48,532 --> 00:18:50,334
AND KNOW
WHO YOU ARE.

543
00:18:50,334 --> 00:18:51,969
BUT SO, I HAD A LOT OF
GOOD COMMENTS AT THE PARTY,

544
00:18:51,969 --> 00:18:53,871
WHICH WAS REALLY
HELPFUL TO ME,

545
00:18:53,871 --> 00:18:56,874
BECAUSE I HAVE BEEN FEELING
VERY, LIKE, IN THE MIDDLE.

546
00:18:56,874 --> 00:18:58,776
TOMORROW,
TOMORROW,

547
00:18:58,776 --> 00:19:00,411
6:30
IN THE MORNING.

548
00:19:00,411 --> 00:19:02,479
ARE YOU GUYS RUNNING OUT
OF GAS?

549
00:19:02,479 --> 00:19:05,482
LIKE, THE PICTURES ARE
A BIG CHUNK OF WHAT MAKES US

550
00:19:05,482 --> 00:19:06,650
GO HOME OR NOT,

551
00:19:06,650 --> 00:19:08,419
AND THAT'S
MY BIGGEST FAULT,

552
00:19:08,419 --> 00:19:10,287
SO I REALLY NEED TO WORK
110 PERCENT ON MY PICTURES,

553
00:19:10,287 --> 00:19:11,589
'CAUSE IF NOT,

554
00:19:11,589 --> 00:19:13,324
THEN I'M GONNA BE
GOING HOME.

555
00:19:16,794 --> 00:19:19,763
♪♪♪

556
00:19:24,835 --> 00:19:26,537
HAVE YOU EVER WOKEN UP--

557
00:19:26,537 --> 00:19:28,672
AND THIS HAPPENS AT HOME
ALL THE TIME--

558
00:19:28,672 --> 00:19:30,574
AND LIKE
YOUR INSIDES HURT?

559
00:19:30,574 --> 00:19:32,209
NO.

560
00:19:32,209 --> 00:19:33,611
WE RECEIVED
TYRA MAIL.

561
00:19:33,611 --> 00:19:34,612
IT SAID, "ARE YOU RUNNING
OUT OF GAS?

562
00:19:34,612 --> 00:19:36,747
"BE READY AT 6:15."

563
00:19:36,747 --> 00:19:39,216
KEENYAH ACTUALLY WON
THE COMPETITION,

564
00:19:39,216 --> 00:19:40,951
OF COURSE, WAS GONNA PICK
BRITTANY TO GO TO, LIKE,

565
00:19:40,951 --> 00:19:42,419
THE BEACHFRONT HOTEL
WITH HER.

566
00:19:42,419 --> 00:19:43,654
IT WAS REALLY GREAT
TO SEE THEM WIN,

567
00:19:43,654 --> 00:19:45,689
BECAUSE
THEY HAVEN'T YET.

568
00:19:47,825 --> 00:19:50,261
ROOM SERVICE.

569
00:19:50,261 --> 00:19:51,595
GOOD MORNING.

570
00:19:51,595 --> 00:19:54,832
AS A BONUS OF OUR WIN,
WE GET TO BE FASHIONABLY LATE.

571
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:57,534
BREAKFAST
IN BED.

572
00:19:57,534 --> 00:19:59,937
IT WAS
WONDERFUL.

573
00:19:59,937 --> 00:20:01,405
WE GOT TO SPEND
THE NIGHT

574
00:20:01,405 --> 00:20:03,240
AND JUST BE TREATED
LIKE ROYALTY, LIKE CELEBRITIES,

575
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:05,509
WHICH WE SOON
WILL BE, HOPEFULLY.

576
00:20:05,509 --> 00:20:06,644
TO BREAKFAST
IN BED

577
00:20:06,644 --> 00:20:07,811
AND MAY THERE BE
MANY MORE.

578
00:20:07,811 --> 00:20:08,913
YEAH!

579
00:20:08,913 --> 00:20:12,549
♪♪♪

580
00:20:12,549 --> 00:20:14,351
WE'RE, LIKE,
IN THE BOONIES,

581
00:20:14,351 --> 00:20:15,352
DRIVING, LIKE,

582
00:20:15,352 --> 00:20:16,420
BY A BUNCH
OF JOSHUA TREES.

583
00:20:17,554 --> 00:20:19,723
♪♪♪

584
00:20:21,792 --> 00:20:25,963
WE'RE THINKING WE'RE GONNA BE
IN MOTORCYCLES AND RACE CARS.

585
00:20:25,963 --> 00:20:29,266
WE ROLL UP TO
A DESERTED GAS STATION.

586
00:20:29,266 --> 00:20:30,834
WELL, THANKS FOR STOPPING BY
TO PICK ME UP

587
00:20:30,834 --> 00:20:32,369
ON MY LITTLE
HITCHHIKE.

588
00:20:32,369 --> 00:20:34,838
WE'RE HERE IN THE MIDDLE
OF THE DESERT.

589
00:20:34,838 --> 00:20:36,307
NOW IN THE DESERT,
OF COURSE,

590
00:20:36,307 --> 00:20:38,609
IT'S GONNA GET VERY HOT
AS THE DAY GOES ALONG,

591
00:20:38,609 --> 00:20:40,945
BUT THESE AREN'T
THE ONLY ELEMENTS

592
00:20:40,945 --> 00:20:42,646
YOU'RE GONNA
BE DEALING WITH TODAY.

593
00:20:42,646 --> 00:20:44,915
OH!

594
00:20:44,915 --> 00:20:47,484
OH, MY GOD!

595
00:20:47,484 --> 00:20:48,485
YOU GUYS CAN
OBVIOUSLY SEE

596
00:20:48,485 --> 00:20:50,287
YOU'VE GOT WIND,

597
00:20:50,287 --> 00:20:52,890
UP TO GALE-FORCE WINDS HERE
YOU GOTTA DEAL WITH.

598
00:20:52,890 --> 00:20:56,226
THE SAME WITH
THIS TORRENTIAL RAIN.

599
00:20:56,226 --> 00:20:58,395
ALL OF THESE ELEMENTS COMBINED
ARE GONNA ADD UP

600
00:20:58,395 --> 00:21:00,230
FOR A HOT,
SULTRY SHOOT.

601
00:21:00,230 --> 00:21:02,399
NOW THE ACTUAL LOOK
FOR TODAY'S SHOOT IS,

602
00:21:02,399 --> 00:21:05,235
WE'RE AT THIS GAS STATION OUT IN
THE MIDDLE OF THE DESERT, RIGHT?

603
00:21:05,235 --> 00:21:08,439
SO YOU GIRLS ARE GONNA BE
THESE SEXY, HOT MECHANICS

604
00:21:08,439 --> 00:21:11,608
ALL GREASED UP,
DEALING WITH THE ELEMENTS.

605
00:21:11,608 --> 00:21:14,411
I'M GONNA BE, LIKE, SCREAMING
FROM BEYOND THE RAIN BARRIER,

606
00:21:14,411 --> 00:21:16,513
'CAUSE I'M NOT GETTING
IN THE RAIN.

607
00:21:16,513 --> 00:21:18,515
NOW TODAY'S
PHOTOGRAPHER

608
00:21:18,515 --> 00:21:20,884
IS SOMEONE WHO'S ACTUALLY
VERY ACCOMPLISHED

609
00:21:20,884 --> 00:21:22,286
AS A PHOTOGRAPHER,

610
00:21:22,286 --> 00:21:23,620
BUT YOU MAY NOT
KNOW WHO.

611
00:21:23,620 --> 00:21:24,688
NO!

612
00:21:24,688 --> 00:21:26,957
THAT'S RIGHT.

613
00:21:26,957 --> 00:21:29,526
OUR PHOTOGRAPHER TODAY
IS MATHU,

614
00:21:29,526 --> 00:21:31,462
WHO'S BEEN DOING
OUR MAKEUP.

615
00:21:31,462 --> 00:21:33,564
MATHU'S ACTUALLY A VERY
ACCOMPLISHED PHOTOGRAPHER

616
00:21:33,564 --> 00:21:35,799
WHO HAS SHOT
LOTS OF CELEBRITIES,

617
00:21:35,799 --> 00:21:37,768
AND HE IS
SUPER-TALENTED.

618
00:21:37,768 --> 00:21:39,636
♪♪♪

619
00:21:39,636 --> 00:21:42,806
AFTER BREAKFAST,
WE WERE TAKEN TO THE SPA.

620
00:21:42,806 --> 00:21:44,575
WE BOTH GOT
MASSAGES,

621
00:21:44,575 --> 00:21:48,879
DEEP TISSUE MASSAGES THAT
WERE SO GOOD, SO WONDERFUL,

622
00:21:48,879 --> 00:21:51,515
THE BEST MASSAGE I'VE EVER HAD
IN MY ENTIRE LIFE.

623
00:21:51,515 --> 00:21:53,450
IT WAS AMAZING.

624
00:21:53,450 --> 00:21:55,886
(wind machine starts)

625
00:21:55,886 --> 00:21:58,622
TODAY'S PHOTO SHOOT IS
ABOUT US BEING SEXY

626
00:21:58,622 --> 00:22:01,658
WHILE GETTING BLOWN AWAY
BY HEAVY WIND AND WATER.

627
00:22:01,658 --> 00:22:02,760
IT'S CRAZY.

628
00:22:02,760 --> 00:22:05,195
♪♪♪

629
00:22:08,532 --> 00:22:10,634
KAHLEN, YOU'RE FIRST,
AND WE GOTTA MAKE THIS WORK.

630
00:22:10,634 --> 00:22:12,336
OKAY.

631
00:22:12,336 --> 00:22:13,704
IT'S JUST A LITTLE BIT
OF RAIN, A LITTLE BIT OF WIND.

632
00:22:13,704 --> 00:22:15,272
PLAY WITH IT,
GET INTO IT.

633
00:22:15,272 --> 00:22:15,806
OKAY.

634
00:22:15,806 --> 00:22:16,974
IT'S ALL
ABOUT YOU.

635
00:22:16,974 --> 00:22:18,776
TO MAKE THE SHOT
EVEN MORE DYNAMIC,

636
00:22:18,776 --> 00:22:21,478
I DECIDED TO PUT A SECOND GIRL
IN THE BACKGROUND.

637
00:22:21,478 --> 00:22:23,247
LET'S GET THIS PARTY
STARTED.

638
00:22:26,450 --> 00:22:29,353
THESE PHOTO SHOOTS THAT WE'RE
DOING ARE A LITTLE EXTREME,

639
00:22:29,353 --> 00:22:30,821
BUT AT
THE SAME TIME,

640
00:22:30,821 --> 00:22:32,856
I'M SURE THAT STUFF LIKE THIS
HAPPENS IN THE FASHION WORLD,

641
00:22:32,856 --> 00:22:35,759
JUST PROBABLY
NOT EVERY WEEK.

642
00:22:35,759 --> 00:22:37,428
WHEN IT COMES
TO JUST POSING,

643
00:22:37,428 --> 00:22:38,395
THAT'S SOMETHING
I'M GOOD AT.

644
00:22:38,395 --> 00:22:39,696
MORE MOVEMENT!

645
00:22:46,970 --> 00:22:48,439
I'M WATCHING
THE GIRL BEHIND ME,

646
00:22:48,439 --> 00:22:51,642
'CAUSE I'M LIKE, "DAMN, PLEASE,
YOU WANT TO SWITCH ME?"

647
00:22:51,642 --> 00:22:54,578
♪♪♪

648
00:22:54,578 --> 00:22:56,313
THE WATER
WAS JUST SO COLD,

649
00:22:56,313 --> 00:22:57,548
AND I WAS JUST,
LIKE, IN SHOCK.

650
00:22:57,548 --> 00:22:58,549
AT FIRST,
I COULDN'T BREATHE.

651
00:22:58,549 --> 00:22:59,583
I WAS LIKE,
"OH!"

652
00:22:59,583 --> 00:23:02,186
AND YOU CAN'T HEAR
ANY DIRECTION.

653
00:23:07,758 --> 00:23:09,960
NO, COME FORWARD.

654
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,195
YEAH.

655
00:23:11,195 --> 00:23:12,629
TIFFANY GOT
A LITTLE BIT DISTRACTED

656
00:23:12,629 --> 00:23:13,730
BY ALL THE GOINGS ON,

657
00:23:13,730 --> 00:23:15,232
BUT SHE ACTUALLY
NAILED IT.

658
00:23:15,232 --> 00:23:16,834
SHE REALLY WENT
FOR VERY STRONG POSES.

659
00:23:16,834 --> 00:23:19,236
IT'S REALLY HARD
TO BE SEXY

660
00:23:19,236 --> 00:23:22,306
WITH WINDS BLOWING,
ABOUT TO KNOCK ME DOWN

661
00:23:22,306 --> 00:23:25,609
AND WATER POPPING ME
IN THE EYE, MOUTH AND NOSE.

662
00:23:25,609 --> 00:23:27,344
GOOD JOB,
TIFFANY.

663
00:23:27,344 --> 00:23:28,679
CAN WE GET
ANOTHER GIRL!

664
00:23:28,679 --> 00:23:30,414
CHRISTINA, YOU CAN
WORK YOUR TIRE

665
00:23:30,414 --> 00:23:33,183
BACKWARDS AND FORWARDS
AND WEAR IT OUT.

666
00:23:33,183 --> 00:23:34,585
I FEEL LIKE
I'M WORKING THE TIRE.

667
00:23:34,585 --> 00:23:36,487
I MEAN,
I'M ALL GREASED UP,

668
00:23:36,487 --> 00:23:37,721
YOU KNOW,
THIS SEXY MECHANIC.

669
00:23:37,721 --> 00:23:41,859
♪♪♪

670
00:23:41,859 --> 00:23:44,194
I'VE NEVER BEEN
TO CALIFORNIA BEFORE,

671
00:23:44,194 --> 00:23:46,196
SO I WANTED TO CHECK OUT
THE BEACH.

672
00:23:47,831 --> 00:23:49,233
COME ON!

673
00:23:50,801 --> 00:23:52,536
BRITTANY
WAS TOTALLY EXCITED.

674
00:23:52,536 --> 00:23:54,238
WE WERE
IN THE WATER

675
00:23:54,238 --> 00:23:55,906
PLAYING AROUND LIKE
WE WERE 5 YEARS OLD,

676
00:23:56,940 --> 00:23:58,642
AND WE HAD
A BALL.

677
00:23:58,642 --> 00:23:59,476
WHOO!

678
00:24:01,745 --> 00:24:07,417
MICHELLE, THIS IS NO TIME
TO BE TIMID.

679
00:24:07,417 --> 00:24:08,719
BUT SHE PROMISED ENERGY.

680
00:24:08,719 --> 00:24:09,953
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT SHE'S DOING.

681
00:24:09,953 --> 00:24:12,289
ENERGY, LAUGH,
DO STUFF!

682
00:24:12,289 --> 00:24:13,891
GIVE ME SOMETHING!

683
00:24:13,891 --> 00:24:14,892
WHAT HAPPENED
TO THE ENERGY?

684
00:24:14,892 --> 00:24:17,227
THIS WAS YOU.

685
00:24:17,227 --> 00:24:18,829
YOU REALLY GOTTA WORK
ON THAT ENERGY THING.

686
00:24:18,829 --> 00:24:20,697
AND I FELT LIKE MICHELLE
WAS GONNA START TO CRY,

687
00:24:20,697 --> 00:24:22,366
BUT YOU GOTTA
BE HONEST,

688
00:24:22,366 --> 00:24:24,568
BECAUSE THE GIRLS HAVE TO LEARN
FROM THEIR MISTAKES,

689
00:24:24,568 --> 00:24:26,537
BUT WE GOT ONE SHOT
ON MICHELLE.

690
00:24:26,537 --> 00:24:27,638
I THOUGHT I WAS DOING
A PRETTY GOOD JOB,

691
00:24:27,638 --> 00:24:29,606
BUT I DON'T KNOW.

692
00:24:29,606 --> 00:24:31,308
THEY'RE MAKING ME
WORRY.

693
00:24:31,308 --> 00:24:32,309
ALL RIGHT,
SO, NAIMA,

694
00:24:32,309 --> 00:24:33,911
WORK THIS LITTLE BIT
