1151
00:40:14,550 --> 00:40:16,953
YOUR CRITIQUE
IS THE SAME.

1152
00:40:16,953 --> 00:40:18,321
FOR REBECCA,

1153
00:40:18,321 --> 00:40:22,492
IT'S BEAUTIFUL GIRL,
BUT SAFE, BORING.

1154
00:40:22,492 --> 00:40:23,793
TOP MODELS
AREN'T BORING.

1155
00:40:23,793 --> 00:40:24,794
THEY'RE EDGY.

1156
00:40:24,794 --> 00:40:25,962
THEY'RE
INTERESTING.

1157
00:40:25,962 --> 00:40:28,531
LLUVY, YOU HAVE
ALL THE POTENTIAL IN THE WORLD,

1158
00:40:28,531 --> 00:40:31,567
BUT FROM WEEK TO WEEK,
YOUR PICTURES SAY OTHERWISE.

1159
00:40:31,567 --> 00:40:35,238
I BELIEVE THAT
YOU HAVE SO MUCH POTENTIAL.

1160
00:40:35,238 --> 00:40:38,341
I THINK THE BOTH OF YOU HAVE HAD
THE WEAKEST PROGRESSION.

1161
00:40:38,341 --> 00:40:40,309
BOTH OF YOU HIT
ON ONE PHOTO SHOOT,

1162
00:40:40,309 --> 00:40:42,879
BUT TO BE ON THE ROAD
TO BEING A TOP MODEL

1163
00:40:42,879 --> 00:40:45,248
IS ABOUT MORE THAN
JUST HITTING IT ONCE,

1164
00:40:45,248 --> 00:40:47,750
AND ONE OF YOU IS GONNA GET
A CHANCE TO HIT IT AGAIN.

1165
00:40:55,324 --> 00:40:57,426
REBECCA.

1166
00:41:01,497 --> 00:41:03,699
CONGRATULATIONS.

1167
00:41:03,699 --> 00:41:04,967
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1168
00:41:04,967 --> 00:41:07,236
AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL.

1169
00:41:07,737 --> 00:41:09,438
THANKS, LLUVY.

1170
00:41:13,276 --> 00:41:14,410
I'M SO LOST
RIGHT NOW.

1171
00:41:14,410 --> 00:41:17,480
I HAVE NO IDEA.

1172
00:41:17,480 --> 00:41:19,715
(sniffling)

1173
00:41:19,715 --> 00:41:22,585
I-- THIS BEING A MODEL HAS BEEN
MY DREAM SINCE I WAS 3.

1174
00:41:22,585 --> 00:41:25,321
I AM NOT THE "COVER GIRL" GIRL,
YOU KNOW?

1175
00:41:25,321 --> 00:41:28,257
BUT I KNOW
I'M STRANGELY BEAUTIFUL.

1176
00:41:28,257 --> 00:41:29,592
MAYBE I'M TOO REALISTIC
FOR THIS.

1177
00:41:29,592 --> 00:41:33,829
MY HEAD'S NOT
IN THE CLOUDS.

1178
00:41:33,829 --> 00:41:36,365
CAREER-WISE, I DON'T KNOW
WHAT I'M GONNA DO.

1179
00:41:36,365 --> 00:41:38,201
I HAVE NO IDEA.

1180
00:41:53,282 --> 00:41:56,719
Tyra: STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

1181
00:41:59,322 --> 00:42:01,824
COMING UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"...

1182
00:42:01,824 --> 00:42:04,560
I WANT YOU
TO MASTER COCKNEY.

1183
00:42:04,560 --> 00:42:05,528
(imitates Cockney accent)
WELL, I DON'T KNOW.

1184
00:42:05,528 --> 00:42:07,296
DO YOU WANT
A GO?

1185
00:42:07,296 --> 00:42:08,364
(imitates Cockney accent)
IF YOU WANT
A GO?

1186
00:42:08,364 --> 00:42:10,266
(imitates Cockney accent)
IF YOU WANT A GO, GO.

1187
00:42:10,266 --> 00:42:11,834
A TOUGH ACTING LESSON

1188
00:42:11,834 --> 00:42:14,437
LEADS UP TO THE GIRLS'
MOST DARING PHOTO SHOOT...

1189
00:42:14,437 --> 00:42:15,304
I ALREADY FEEL
THE HEART GOING.

1190
00:42:15,304 --> 00:42:16,505
OH, MY GOD!

1191
00:42:16,505 --> 00:42:17,607
DON'T BE AFRAID
OF HIM.

1192
00:42:17,607 --> 00:42:18,608
BRING YOUR CHIN UP,
TIFFANY,

1193
00:42:18,608 --> 00:42:19,709
BRING YOUR CHIN UP!

1194
00:42:19,709 --> 00:42:21,611
FOR REAL, THAT WAS HARDER
THAN I THOUGHT.

1195
00:42:21,611 --> 00:42:24,880
AT ELIMINATIONS, ONE MODEL
SENDS ME OVER THE EDGE.

1196
00:42:24,880 --> 00:42:26,449
BE QUIET!

